{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4(x-5)(x+2)(x+2) & =-4(x-5)({x}^{2}+4x+4) \\\\  & =-4({x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+4x-5{x}^{2}-20x-20) \\\\  & =-4({x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-16x-20) \\\\  & =-4{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+64x+80.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=-4{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+64x+80.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/state.json" "file_sha256" "ebb2ab24a09bcbad51dbcac6c716898fe8fd38dcf09b0535e41b32dd06948a73"} {"question" "q-316635" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bfe3adfafb68eebdc66a7865cc0e4b1ccb2ba40604ae4045fb70bef5d013dd70"} {"question" "q-316635" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/state.json" "file_sha256" "ebb2ab24a09bcbad51dbcac6c716898fe8fd38dcf09b0535e41b32dd06948a73"} {"question" "q-316635" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-4"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/state.json" "file_sha256" "ebb2ab24a09bcbad51dbcac6c716898fe8fd38dcf09b0535e41b32dd06948a73"} {"question" "q-316635" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/state.json" "file_sha256" "ebb2ab24a09bcbad51dbcac6c716898fe8fd38dcf09b0535e41b32dd06948a73"} {"question" "q-316635" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "4"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/state.json" "file_sha256" "ebb2ab24a09bcbad51dbcac6c716898fe8fd38dcf09b0535e41b32dd06948a73"} {"question" "q-316635" "field" "field-3" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/state.json" "file_sha256" "ebb2ab24a09bcbad51dbcac6c716898fe8fd38dcf09b0535e41b32dd06948a73"} {"question" "q-316635" "field" "field-3" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "64"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/state.json" "file_sha256" "ebb2ab24a09bcbad51dbcac6c716898fe8fd38dcf09b0535e41b32dd06948a73"} {"question" "q-316635" "field" "field-4" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/state.json" "file_sha256" "ebb2ab24a09bcbad51dbcac6c716898fe8fd38dcf09b0535e41b32dd06948a73"} {"question" "q-316635" "field" "field-4" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "80"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/state.json" "file_sha256" "ebb2ab24a09bcbad51dbcac6c716898fe8fd38dcf09b0535e41b32dd06948a73"} {"question" "q-316725" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/assets/dd92f4b41c95c436027cce015b688df1a982f46913b0ea262f2d30e1e49259d5.png)\n\nThe Argand diagram above shows the roots of the cubic polynomial $f(x).$ Find $f(x)$ given that the coefficient of the cubic term is $-2.$\n\n$f(x)=$\n{{field-1}}${x}^{3}\\,-$\n{{field-2}}$x\\,+$\n{{field-3}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/state.json" "file_sha256" "ebb2ab24a09bcbad51dbcac6c716898fe8fd38dcf09b0535e41b32dd06948a73"} {"question" "q-316725" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "From the diagram, we see that $f(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=2$ and ${x}_{2,3}=-1\\pm 3\\text{i}.$ Additionally, we're given that the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=-2.$ Therefore, we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) \\\\  & =-2(x-2)(x-(-1+3\\text{i}))(x-(-1-3\\text{i}))\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2(x-2)(x-(-1+3\\text{i}))(x-(-1-3\\text{i})) & = \\\\ -2(x-2)({x}^{2}-x(-1-3\\text{i})-x(-1+3\\text{i})+(-1+3\\text{i})(-1-3\\text{i})) & = \\\\ -2(x-2)({x}^{2}+2x+10) & = \\\\ -2({x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+10x-2{x}^{2}-4x-20) & = \\\\ -2({x}^{3}+6x-20) & = \\\\ -2{x}^{3}-12x+40 & .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)=-2{x}^{3}-12x+40.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/state.json" "file_sha256" "ebb2ab24a09bcbad51dbcac6c716898fe8fd38dcf09b0535e41b32dd06948a73"} {"question" "q-316725" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bfe3adfafb68eebdc66a7865cc0e4b1ccb2ba40604ae4045fb70bef5d013dd70"} {"question" "q-316725" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065074/state.json" "file_sha256" "ebb2ab24a09bcbad51dbcac6c716898fe8fd38dcf09b0535e41b32dd06948a73"} {"question" "q-316725" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-2"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065